        "v": [
          "\n-  We classified 4 files: 1 data, 1 code, 2 documentation.\n-  We found 1 tabular data file and extracted 2 columns from 1 of them.\n-  We grouped the files into 1 study group (ex1).\n-  The study-group step did not get an answer for 4 files (the model request failed); they were grouped by the fallback rules instead. We ran automated data-quality checks on 2 columns and found no issues."
